id: pm-4flipp
title: "Regression: governance dedupe audit again rejects the explicit all-lifecycle status sentinel"
description: "In the current 2026.8.1 checkout, pm dedupe-audit --mode title_exact --status all --limit 10000 --json exits invalid_argument_value even though closed canonical issue pm-mp49 records explicit --status all support as implemented and verified. Omitting --status considers all 2,263 items, so behavior, documentation, recovery guidance, and the closed contract have drifted apart. This is a recurrence linked to pm-mp49, not a duplicate of its historical delivery."
